      "options": {
        "content": "## Investigation Workflow\n\n1. Trigger a business flow such as login, transfer, or payment.\n2. Confirm request rate changes in this dashboard.\n3. Use Grafana Explore with **Loki** to find the same request by `correlationId` or service name.\n4. Use Grafana Explore with **Tempo** to inspect the distributed trace.\n5. Confirm Kafka side effects in `audit-service` and `notification-service`.\n\nThis dashboard is intentionally focused on business traffic and excludes `/actuator/prometheus` scrape noise.",
